    CMR -->|configmaps CRUD| Core
    GWR -->|gateways read, httproutes + referencegrants CRUD| GW
    LER --> LeaderRes

    subgraph UserRoles["Aggregated user roles"]
        Edit["kuberay-edit-role /<br/>rayjob-, rayservice-, raycronjob-editor-role"]
        View["kuberay-view-role /<br/>rayjob-, rayservice-, raycronjob-viewer-role"]
    end
    Edit -->|CRUD| Ray
    View -->|get, list, watch| Ray

